text:
Whoever contravenes the provisions of section 6, 7 or 8 with respect to: (a) narcotic dirt, cannabis or leaves of the coca plant where quantity is 100 grams or less, shall be punishable with imprisonment which may extend to two years, or with fine, or with both;
(b) where quantity exceeds 100 grams but does not exceed 1000 grams, shall be punishable with imprisonment which may extend to seven years and with fine;
(c) where quantity exceeds 1000 grams, shall be punishable with death, or imprisonment for life, or imprisonment for a term which may extend to fourteen years and with fine which may be up to one million rupees.

